# F429 UVC detection arm: OTG_HS full-speed host + CherryUSB's DWC2 port +
# the video class.  One case brings the controller up, identifies the camera
# and prints its mode/alt/interval tables plus the 720-line probe census; it
# does not commit a stream, so this image needs no SDRAM frame pool.
#
# The census answers whether the camera asks for more than a full-speed
# isochronous endpoint can carry: 1023 bytes per 1 ms frame is the ceiling.
CONFIG_ARCH_ARM_V7M=y
CONFIG_BACKEND_FREERTOS=y
CONFIG_OPT_O2=y
CONFIG_PROFILE_BASE=y
CONFIG_BOARD_STM32F429_CHALLENGER=y
CONFIG_FREERTOS_HEAP_SIZE=65536
CONFIG_BOARD_AUTO_RESET=n
CONFIG_RUNNER_STACK_KB=24
CONFIG_CASES="uvc_detect"
